      "extract": "Here we describe a quantum circuit of size poly(n) that prepares a state |ψg⟩/∥ψg∥; see Eq. (15). Our circuit applies the quantum Fourier transform over group Sn to a certain subset state constructed in the following lemma. Lemma 3. Let g ∈Sn be a permutation and Cg ⊆Sn be the conjugacy class of g. There exists a quantum circuit of size poly(n) that prepares a subset state |Cg⟩= 1 \u0011|Cg| \u0002 h∈Cg |h⟩. (22) We defer the",
