      "extract": "KOSTKA NUMBERS In Sec. IV we showed that Crichigno and Prakash’s con- nection between quantum spin chains and characters of the symmetric group can be leveraged in an MPS algorithm for characters. In Ref. [13] they also proved mappings between spin chains and Kostka numbers and Littlewood- Richardson coeﬃcients. Using similar ideas to characters, we show that this correspondence can be used to give an MPS algorithm",
